---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="Products | Virtual Concept Technologies"
  description="Explore products and SaaS solutions developed by Virtual Concept Technologies."
>
  <main>

    <section class="bg-white">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-24 lg:px-8 lg:py-32">

        <div class="max-w-4xl">

          <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-blue-600">
            VCT / Products
          </p>

          <h1 class="mt-6 text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-6xl">
            Products built to solve real problems.
          </h1>

          <p class="mt-7 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
            Virtual Concept Technologies develops focused software products
            and AI-powered SaaS solutions designed around practical needs.
          </p>

        </div>


        <div class="mt-16 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">

          <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-8 sm:p-10">

            <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-blue-600">
              Product Portfolio
            </p>

            <h2 class="mt-5 text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-950">
              VCT Product Portfolio
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-600">
              Our portfolio of software products is being developed around
              specific business, technology, and operational challenges.
            </p>

            <div class="mt-8">
              <span class="inline-flex rounded-full bg-white px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 ring-1 ring-slate-200">
                Coming Soon
              </span>
            </div>

          </article>


          <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-8 sm:p-10">

            <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-blue-600">
              SaaS
            </p>

            <h2 class="mt-5 text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-950">
              AI-Powered SaaS
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-600">
              Focused SaaS products that combine useful workflows,
              intelligent automation, and secure digital experiences.
            </p>

            <div class="mt-8">
              <span class="inline-flex rounded-full bg-white px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 ring-1 ring-slate-200">
                In Development
              </span>
            </div>

          </article>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>


    <section class="bg-slate-50">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-20 lg:px-8 lg:py-24">

        <div class="max-w-3xl">

          <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-blue-600">
            Product Development
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-5 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">
            From concept to useful product.
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
            Products can begin as an idea, prototype, or operational problem.
            We can help turn that starting point into a focused digital
            product with the right technical foundation.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-8">
            <a
              href="/contact/"
              class="inline-flex rounded-lg bg-blue-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-blue-700"
            >
              Discuss a Product
            </a>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
</MainLayout>
